# Kandidat A: nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4 pa EN DGX Spark (ca 124 GiB, varav
# 50 GiB PLE/MTP-fil). Licens: NVIDIA Open Model License ovanpa Qwen Community
# License 1.0 (intern anvandning ar undantagen fran MaaS-villkoret; kundens jurist avgor).
# Utgangslage enligt forumrecept (2026-09-11): https://forums.developer.nvidia.com/t/382957
# OBS: flaggorna nedan hor ihop med den specialbyggda bilden i det receptet
# (pilcothink/vllm_spark_qwen38:0.29, b12x-backends, PLE avlastad till disk).
# De fungerar INTE i en standardbild. Modellkortet ger bara ett 8xB200-recept.
# Alternativt recept: github.com/eugr/spark-vllm-docker
#   recipes/qwen3.8-flash-next-nvfp4-solo.yaml
# I llm.env behovs da ocksa:  LLM_DOCKER_EXTRA="-e VLLM_PLE_SSD=1"
# (--ulimit memlock/stack satts redan av start.sh)
# Otestat av oss. Hamta i bakgrunden medan B och C mats.
--distributed-executor-backend mp
--tensor-parallel-size 1
--dtype bfloat16
--trust-remote-code
--load-format safetensors
--safetensors-load-strategy lazy
--engram-config.cpu_offload false
--moe-backend b12x
--linear-backend b12x
--no-enable-flashinfer-autotune
-cc.mode none
-cc.cudagraph_mode FULL_DECODE_ONLY
--gpu-memory-utilization 0.8
--enable-prefix-caching
--enable-chunked-prefill
--reasoning-parser qwen3
--tool-call-parser qwen3_xml
--enable-auto-tool-choice
--max-model-len 262144
--max-num-batched-tokens 4096
--max-num-seqs 2
--speculative-config {"method":"mtp","num_speculative_tokens":3,"moe_backend":"auto"}
